# Reversal Mountain's cave (the heat in the rock, drips and a slow pulse): a sparse marimba figure in A minor over a held choir
# drone, a low string line and a timpani that beats like a heart a long way down. The cave plays the same by day and by night, as
# the original's caves do. Original composition for this game (plan 22 · U7, part b).
title Reversal Mountain Cave
tempo 80
meter 4/4
reverb 0.42
night none

